NOTE ON IMAGES: The polluted images in this dataset are derivative works of
publicly available source images identified by the `original_image_url` field in
the accompanying CSV files. The CC BY 4.0 license above applies to the dataset's
annotations, captions, and metadata. Use of the images themselves should respect
the licenses and terms of the original source materials. The dataset is provided
for research on the robustness and security of multimodal retrieval-augmented
generation systems.
